    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108334532b5f202f842b74aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这之后，\n吉兆宣示会将今天的失败活用于未来，\n在下场比赛展现“成果”，就此站上崭新的起点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54d5a4a9b4632dd5eb56f0e869904010412b001a99e8cf319088e0473c08ed7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661bab8d6a693912f1495c30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・Fork",
