    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da213bb9d6de555b45c7d3b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆称霸了“天皇赏（秋）”。\n观众们震慑于她的强悍实力。\n但她认为这次胜利只是起点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2357fc7a4dce978717e1d7dce13f370c39c246631a23e8b357b55cabbbf2423",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70b3ee7f2749acba684f268",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
