    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaad5609c4df50d1fb5544af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆在“有马纪念”上，\n使出了浑身解数。观众肯定了她的实力，\n开始以友善态度看待她的冷淡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9762a5023bd6790f4a646e430dcb367cd0f5a991e3eaec16e50a725c69e68353",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083425.json",
      "json_path": [
