    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f4dc01fd9d2a3c598ff0af9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到吉兆的表现刺激，\n美妙姿势与跳舞城下定决心，\n要让自己的热情更加上一层楼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa13e57e0547ed65a0449d29fde1e782a2928356d291098860b7b86d5e540926",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
