      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆与训练员\n打算更进一步地展现绝对的强悍。\n他们认为这样做定能为竞赛界带来新的影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f231b91bedd25738da357ce802710a2d60f92e316d845c679e7639f3fc6443",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
